{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abnormal event occurred in the model town of Silver Lake, a mistake in a secret government nuclear test at a small power plant unleashed a wave of chaos, which continues to spread...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silverlake pixel-art top-view game with roguelike elements. Combining exploration, permadeath, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps randomly generated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid combat system, with a mix of real-time turns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills to enhance specific elements of the survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with your character's needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and items to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. Upcoming updates planned:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer update.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Open World Update.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717620?t=1753991095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717620?t=1753991095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717620/1f8e349e4536ac31878da53e1e308abf60295f39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753991095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717620/1f8e349e4536ac31878da53e1e308abf60295f39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753991095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class